<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Jan industrial output up 11 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Hungary Jan industrial output up 11 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's industrial  output rose 11 percent in January compared to December and was 6.4 percent above January, 1996, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said on Friday.  </p>
<p>HUNGARY INDUSTRY OUTPUT</p>
<p>   (Pct)		    Jan '97    Dec '96    Jan '96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change  +11.0	-6.4	 +5.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year change    + 6.4	+3.3	 +0.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Industrial sales rose by 4.8 percent in January over January 1996, with domestic sales falling 4.7 percent and exports rising almost 29 percent, KSH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
